			<Priority>2</Priority>
			<QuestPack>0</QuestPack>
			<QuestTID>12022</QuestTID>
			<Speech><![CDATA[...예? 모은 돈으로 뭘 할 거냐고요?]]></Speech>
			<Voice><![CDATA[ ]]></Voice>
		</ROW>
