			<Image><![CDATA[img_quest_npc_004]]></Image>
			<NpcID>4</NpcID>
			<Priority>6</Priority>
			<QuestPack>2</QuestPack>
			<QuestTID>11045</QuestTID>
			<Speech><![CDATA[잠깐 생각을 좀 할게.
조금 이따가 다시 말을 걸어줄래?]]></Speech>
			<Voice><![CDATA[ ]]></Voice>
