			<Value><![CDATA[How have you been? Now that you’ve finally gotten
your own horse, I can finally send you a letter with
an important request.
It must be a lot of pressure adapting to a new place,
but wouldn’t you come and help look after the ranch?
Since I’ll be away at the competition, someone is
needed to take care of the ranch...
The ranch animals and I are waiting for you!
Please come quickly.]]></Value>
